These frames only show the countdown/early-start moments (~3–4 seconds in) and confirm the race begins normally. They do **not** contradict the ~43-second lap time predicted by physics.

## Verdict

The demo path's first step (`KeyW` held for ~50 seconds) provides continuous acceleration sufficient to reach max speed and lap the track in approximately **42–44 seconds** — within the 45-second window. The finish is backed by genuine positional tracking (`kart.t` wrapping from >0.9 to <0.1), not a cosmetic overlay.

